---
/**
 * The page for an address that has none.
 *
 * Without this file a reader who mistypes a URL, or follows an old link, gets
 * GitHub's own 「Page not found · GitHub Pages」 — an English error page with
 * GitHub's branding, no indication of which site they were trying to reach, and
 * no link back into the document. On this site they fall out of a
 * Chinese-language reanalysis and land on someone else's black-and-white
 * apology.
 *
 * It matters more here than on most sites because the addresses have already
 * moved. The document used to be a single page of ten chapters — 38,291px of it
 * — and every chapter was an in-page anchor; then it became ten routes, and the
 * numbering was renumbered once by hand across eight files when a chapter was
 * inserted in the middle. Both of those turned live links into dead ones, and
 * the project's own README still carries an anchor from before the split.
 *
 * So this page does one job: put the reader back into the table of contents. It
 * is the ten-chapter index, the same component the entry page uses, above the
 * one sentence that says what happened. Every link goes through `href()`, which
 * is root-absolute, because a 404 is served AT the address that failed and a
 * relative link from an unknown depth would fail with it.
 *
 * GitHub Pages serves `/404.html` for any unmatched path under the project
 * site, which is what Astro builds this into. Astro's dev server does the same
 * for an unknown route, so the page can be checked locally.
 */
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ChapterIndex from "../components/ChapterIndex.astro";
import { href } from "../lib/chapters";
---

<Base
  title="找不到這個頁面 — air-quality"
  description="這個位址在本站沒有對應的頁面。全部十章的目錄在這裡。"
  unaddressed
>
  <section id="notfound" class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">404</p>
    <h1>這個位址沒有頁面</h1>

    <p class="lede">
      可能是網址打錯了，也可能是舊連結——這份文件曾經是<strong
        >單一頁面的十個章節</strong
      >，後來每一章各自成頁，章節編號也重新編過一次。當時的頁內錨點現在都指不到東西。
    </p>

    <p>
      下面是全部十章。從<a href={href()}>首頁</a>開始也可以，
      那裡有這份重新分析的結論與監測網的全貌。
    </p>

    <h2 class="visually-hidden">完整章節目錄</h2>
    <ChapterIndex />
  </section>
</Base>
